---
import AskQuack from "../islands/AskQuack";

const specs = [
  ["参数量", "1(黄色)"],
  ["权重", "28 g,完全开放"],
  ["上下文窗口", "恰好一张书桌"],
  ["输出词表", "1 个 token"],
  ["确定性", "绝对"],
  ["功耗", "0 W"],
  ["推理延迟", "0 ms(提前算好了)"],
];
---

<section id="model" class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-28 md:py-40">
  <div class="glow -top-20 right-0 h-96 w-96"></div>
  <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal><span class="idx">01</span>QUACK-1 · 旗舰模型</p>
  <h2 class="h-section mt-4 max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
    由 AI<sup class="text-accent">*</sup> 驱动
  </h2>
  <p
    class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-dim"
    data-reveal
  >
    QUACK 不只是一只鸭子。它是一系列史无前例的 AI*
    突破的结晶:完全开放权重(整整 28
    克)、纯端侧推理,上下文窗口恰好覆盖一张书桌。
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-cream-dim" data-reveal>
    * 水禽智能(Aquatic Intelligence)
  </p>

  <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2" data-reveal>
    <AskQuack client:visible />
    <div class="card flex flex-col justify-between p-6">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">模型卡</p>
        <dl class="space-y-3 font-mono text-sm">
          {
            specs.map(([k, v]) => (
              <div class="flex justify-between gap-6 border-b border-cream/10 pb-3">
                <dt class="text-cream-dim">{k}</dt>
                <dd class="text-right">{v}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs text-cream-dim">
        AI 总会自动脑补。我们说的是"橡皮鸭调试法",它听成了"资深主任工程师"。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
